          <caption>
            <p>Rash and Scabies Sites. The image illustrates common scabies sites and pruritic areas, marked in pink. Mikael H&#x000e4;ggstr&#x000f6;m, <ext-link xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" ext-link-type="uri" xlink:href="https://www.cdc.gov/dpdx/scabies/index.html">Public Domain</ext-link>, Centers for Disease Control and Prevention</p>
